====================================================================================================
v128  DOES THE SHIFTED ESTIMATOR SURVIVE SHOT NOISE?
====================================================================================================
  v127 gave the shifted amplitude a flat bond dimension. This asks whether
  the estimator built on it is usable, which v127 did not test. TIER A -
  32768 shots per circuit, matched budgets, both methods cost 3 circuits.

